			"Message": "build(Wind): Regenerate Effect-TS upstream service bindings from updated VS Code source\n\nRe-run Wind/Codegen to refresh the generated artifacts under Source/Effect/Generated/ against updated upstream VS Code platform source. The regenerated bindings surface upstream additions and interface shape changes: IExtensionsWorkbenchService gains isAutoUpdateDelayed and getAutoUpdateDelayRemaining; IWindowsMainService.openAgentsWindow accepts initialQuery, sessionResource, and preferredSessionType parameters; ISandboxHelperService adds buildWindowsMxcSandboxPayload for Windows MXC sandbox policy; IDefaultAccountService includes managedSettingsFetchStatus; IWindowsMxcTerminalSandboxRuntime.createConfig becomes async and accepts a buildSandboxPayload callback; ISessionsManagementService.setActive accepts undefined to support deactivation. IAgentHostCustomizationService is renamed from IAgentHostCustomAgentsService to match its upstream source path.\n\nServiceCatalog and CommandCatalog versions are bumped to 2026-05-30 with 551 command entries, and all source line references are realigned to the updated upstream files.",
			"SHA": "15c4f3e4c9ca8bebcf674fefa2c6bfe6f8bcb745"
		}
